															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zanilo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7117511); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7117511&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607946536" alt="Zanilo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7117511)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zanilo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7117511); return false;" >Zanilo</a></span> <span class="odate time_1607715512 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">11 Dec 2020 19:38</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4842488">
									

<p>A horror/historical SCP submission used by the authoritarian military regime in Brazil.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights</strong>: Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror, History</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong></p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A massive entity that behaves like a stomach, residing deep underground that came to the attention of the Foundation after sensors discovered tremors from 2.5 to 4.6 at Richter’s scale. It tries to lure people using voices in their heads and upon entering the underground tunnels electrical light sources stop working. Everytime it consumes a victim it grows larger and larger.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> It was used by the authoritarian military regime in Brazil during the Cold War to vanish those who oppose the dictatorship. But little to nothing is known about the entity because the archives were almost all destroyed when the regime fell.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Still, partly destroyed documents were found by the Foundation corroborating that fact. They also found a note from a soldier that indicates that the entity was once human, or at least had a humanoid form.</p>
<p>“What we are doing here is heinous. A blasphemy! We are feeding that man in the pit with innocent people, and its growing larger and larger. And after all that, everything that he heard, echoing, trembling the walls, is its stomach, demanding more.”</p>
<p>Unfortunately the Foundation interrupted tests with Class-D personnel to stop further growth of the entity.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The entity has a historical context since it was used by a dictatorship to vanish those who oppose the regime.</p>
<p>Also there are little to no information about the creature because the archives were destroyed, increasing its mystery, origin, and how it has grown so large that can create small earth tremors.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> After all the technical information about the entity, the note from the soldier is the final part of the document, so I want to have more impact in the reader!</p>
<p>Thank you for the help and have a great day! </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
