<p>Oh, I love this but I suppose I'm biased because I'm Brazilian and our military dictatorship period both terrifies and fascinates me. I like how you took one of the core aspects of it (the disappearance of oppositors, the destruction of data, the lack of information) and turned it into an anomaly without taking the responsibility away from those who commited such atrocities.<br />
Brazilian dictatorship is not a widely discussed or known topic and I think you can tie it well with the SCP universe. The strongest point of you idea seems to be the narrative and characters and not the anomaly itself, so I would focus on them. I truly hope you can get this idea into the main page!</p>

