<p>Hello!</p>
<p>I like how you imagined a Sarlacc because the entity I envisioned was completely different! i think this really increases the mystery behind the monster, letting the reader imagine more of it.</p>
<p>1) The idea of cattle was great! I am really going to add it to the document! Since the Foundation don't have enought information about the creature I think they would try to conduct some experiments and use Class-D subjects for more risk tasks, not exactly sending them to death. I will try to make it more clear!</p>
<p>2) My first idea was to put it in a region of Brazil that have small tremors that people hardly fell like 2.5, but in that same region on 1997 a tremor of 4.6 with no victims ocurred there. Since earthquakes in Brazil are really rare I was thinking about explaining those small tremors with the entity.</p>
<p>Thanks for your feedback! Have a great day! :)</p>

