														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4844224">
									

<blockquote>
<p>The entity has a historical context since it was used by a dictatorship to vanish those who oppose the regime.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em>Why wouldn't this dictatorship just kill people in a nonanomalous way? My biggest concern here is the lack of try connection between your political story and the anomaly. I would suggest trying to tailor this anomaly to be more thematically tied to your authoritarian government storyline&#8230;</em></p>
<blockquote>
<p>Unfortunately the Foundation interrupted tests with Class-D personnel to stop further growth of the entity.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em>Additionally, this doesn't seem reasonable. WHY would the Foundation even begin testing with D-class in the first place? Ground penetrating radar would identify the organism and simple exploration with drones would avoid loss of human life. The inclusion of D-class just to be killed seems a bit old fashioned for my tastes.</em></p>
<hr />
<p>Additionally, the massive subterranean organic SCP feeding on people is a little overdone imo, especially good example is <a href="/scp-2191">SCP-2191</a> but there are others.</p>

							</div>

								
					
